---
title: 'Android Tap-to-Pay 0.17.4'
tags: ['Android', 'Tap to Pay', 'SDK']
publishedDate: 2025-08-26
---

### Fixes

- Fixed a crash that occurred when the user attempted to make a payment without explicitly setting `skipSuccessScreen` parameter.
- Fixed a bug in Pixel 8 and Pixel 9 devices with Android 16 where the payment would immediately fail a transaction with timeout error.
